flowchart TB
  R[Recommendation in Slack] --> S[Seller]
  S --> A[Accept]
  S --> X[Mark done]
  S --> Z[Snooze]
  S --> DM[Dismiss]
  S --> C[Correct + reason]
  A --> W[CRM: associate contact, create task]
  X --> W2[CRM: complete task]
  Z --> T[Resurface after N days]
  DM --> SP[Suppress play for account, 30 days]
  C --> CP[Undo CRM writes already made]
  C --> EX[wrong_person: identity exclusion<br/>under every subject key]
  C --> SP2[wrong_play / already_engaged: suppression]
  EX --> RE[Re-evaluate the signal now]
  SP --> F[Future decisions]
  SP2 --> F
  T --> F
  RE --> F
  classDef s fill:#e8edfd,stroke:#3b5bdb,color:#1d2330
  class A,X,Z,DM,C s
